  "knowledge": "Critical Equipment",
  "description": "Identifies equipment that is essential for life support and safety in polar environments.",
  "definition": "Equipment is designated as 'Critical' if it belongs to the 'Safety' equipment type, has a safety index > 0.8, and is associated with any of these life-critical systems: lifesupportstatus, oxygensupplystatus, or heater systems where temperatures are below freezing (externaltemperaturec < 0)."
}

